   "email": "person",
   "message": "SEB-301: backlog 29a was already built, tick it (PR #743) (#798)\n\nNeeds-claude: the Aider builder re-attempted this job and failed\ntwice, but tests/agent_board_bitget_GHS.py and its config were\nalready merged to main on 2026-10-31 (PR #743). The builder had\nnot ticked BACKLOG.md, so it kept retrying an already-built job.\n520 rows of data/p2p_basis_boards.csv confirm the collector has\nbeen running since. This is a bookkeeping fix only, no code change.\n\nCo-authored-by: Sebastian Roervig <sebastian.roervig@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>"
  },
  {
   "sha": "7a74b7a2f163e5588c3704dcf625809eaf918df4",
   "html_url": "https://github.com/SebR214/margin/commit/7a74b7a2f163e5588c3704dcf625809eaf918df4",
   "date": "2026-11-12T14:53:53Z",
   "email": "person",
   "message": "SEB-301: daily gap history for flagged source pairs (backlog 28a) (#797)\n\n* SEB-301: daily gap history for flagged source pairs (backlog 28a)\n\nNeeds-claude: the Aider builder failed twice (empty after Aider, then\nno files changed). tools/pair_gap_daily.py reuses emit_source_pairs's\nper-source hourly prices, groups the hours a flagged pair shares into\nUTC days, and writes data/pair_gap_daily.csv with the median gap in\npercent and the hours compared per currency, pair and day.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* SEB-301: tick backlog 28a with its PR number\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Sebastian Roervig <sebastian.roervig@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>"
  },
